                "xmlns:c2pa=\"http://c2pa.org/manifest\"><metadata><c2pa:manifest></c2pa:manifest></metadata>\n<title "
                "id=\"f3t\">Histograms of the numbers in the three ciphers, bins of fifty</title>\n<text "
