            "Two bad arguments retired: the claim that ergot alkaloids decay within a year (unsound; "
            "Barger 1931), and the 1951 mass poisoning at Pont-Saint-Esprit in southern France as a case "
            "of ergot-induced mass behaviour (organic mercury, according to the European Food Safety "
