            "chose, the midpoint of the west parcel of William White, a neighbour on Sullivan's side, the "
            "houses between rise above the line to the barn's ridge, and from the half-lot two parcels "
            "further west it reaches the barn's wall three feet above the ground. Table 1 shows how the "
