            "Hannibal Crosses the Alps (1998); Hunt's Hannibal (2017); Lancel's Hannibal (1995); Hoyte's "
            "Trunk Road for Hannibal (1960), the account of a crossing made with an elephant in 1959; "
            "Seibert's Hannibal (1993); Proctor's Hannibal's March in History (1971); Mahaney's "
            "Hannibal's Odyssey (2008); Kuhle and Kuhle's two papers in the journal Archaeometry (2012 "
            "and 2015); and Mahaney's papers of 2010, 2013 and 2019 with the publisher Wiley. Their "
            "arguments are known here from what other published writers report of them, and from what "
            "they report of one another.",
