            "Wikisource website, with the apparatus (the record of what the manuscripts read) of the "
            "Oxford edition from scans; the apparatus of Polybius at 3.49.6, the passage naming the "
            "Island's river, is known only through Schweighäuser, an editor of Polybius in 1789, and the "
