                "valley-floor paths between named waypoints, one colour per route, keyed in the legend "
                "under the map. Line style separates routes that share a valley: the Mont-Cenis and "
                "Montgenèvre routes are solid, the Clapier and Traversette routes are dashed, the Petit "
