        "writers: Holmberg 1992 on Clark's letters to his brother; Guice 2002 on the moonless night, "
        "which the calculation here confirms; the Lewis researcher Ann Rogers 2005 on the shot sequence "
        "being a presumption; Michael Carrick, a firearms historian, 2006/2009 on the pistols; Tom "
