            "Morris 2004 (for suicide), Turnbow's two books, Jenkinson beyond chapter VI. Everything on "
            "the death in We Proceeded On from 1974 to 2025 was read, apart from the two print-only "
            "issues listed below; the books were read only in the passages that searches of their "
            "digitised copies return, so the position each takes is certain and its page-by-page argument "
